{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Stow Player 是一款專為擁有本地媒體檔案的用戶設計的離線音頻播放器，適合音樂收藏者、有聲書聽眾及需要管理大量講座錄音的人士。該應用不依賴雲端服務且無廣告干擾，讓用戶能完全掌控自己的音頻庫，目前正提供限時免費下載機會。</p>\n\n<h2>全功能離線音頻播放體驗</h2>\n<p>透過 Wi-Fi 傳輸或 Files 應用程式輕鬆匯入音樂與播客等音頻文件。支援建立資料夾、播放清單與標籤以整理龐大麴庫，具備 CarPlay 兼容、睡眠定時器、交叉淡入淡出及內建均衡器等進階功能。全程離線運行保護隱私，並提供小工具快速存取，是打造個人專屬高品質音頻中心的高效解決方案。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-128-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-129-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-130-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-131-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-132-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-133-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Stow Player</li>\n<li>應用類別：Music</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T15:18:34.547188+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}